  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_01
    value: <style=title><size=30>ADJACENT PAY</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01_1
    value: '<size=20>- 3 or more consecutive symbols appearing on a payline awards
      a win.

      - Symbols do not have to begin from the leftmost reel.</size></Style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01_2
    value: <size=20>     Examples of pays awarded:</size></Style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_01_3
    value: <size=20>     Examples of no pays awarded:</size></Style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_7
    value: <style=title><size=32>BONUS SYMBOL</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_9
    value: <style=title><size=32>MYSTERY SYMBOL</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BONUS_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>15 Free Games</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>10 Free Games</style>

      3 <style=coinColor> 7  Free Games</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_7
    value: "<size=15>- 3 or more consecutive Bonus symbols on a winning payline\n
      \ triggers Free Games.\n- If Free Games is triggered on multiple paylines, the
      sum of \n  free spins from each line will be awarded.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_9
    value: "<size=15>   Mystery Symbols are transformed to\n   a random symbol (excluding
      Bonus\n   symbol)at the end of each reel stop.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_03
    value: <style=title><size=30>HOLD & RE-SPIN</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03
    value: "<size=20>- A full stack of 3 Mystery symbols on reel 3 triggers Hold &
      Re-Spin.\n\n- Reel 3 will lock in place, while the remaining reels re-spin once.
      \n\n- If any additional lock symbol appears in any position, lock them in place\n
      \  too and award 1 additional re-spin.\n\n- Re-spins continue until no additional
      lock symbol appears, or if the screen\n   gets filled with the lock symbol.\n\n-
      Player is awarded for any wins formed at the end of re-spins.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_03_1
    value: <style=title><size=30>Double Reward</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_1
    value: "<size=20>- Double Reward is triggered if user receives a full screen of
      symbols transformed from\n   a full stack of\_ Mystery symbols on reel 3.\n\n-
      When triggered, x2 is multiplied to all wins.\n\n- When Double Reward is triggered,
      Hold & Re-Spin cannot be triggered.\_</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_04_1
    value: <style=title><size=30>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_04_1
    value: "<size=24>- 3 or more consecutive Bonus symbols on a winning payline triggers\n
      \ Free Games.\n\n- If Free Games is triggered on multiple paylines, the sum
      of free spins from\n  each line will be awarded.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_04_2
    value: <style=title><size=30>REPLICA REELS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_04_2
    value: "<size=24>- During each Free Game spin, the player will randomly trigger
      the Replica\n  Reels bonus.\n\n- When triggered, 2 to 5 reels randomly become
      gold reels. \n\n- Gold reels all switch to reveal replicated reels.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>10 LINES</color></size>
